# Units this dir used to deploy and must now be absent on every station.
# One basename per line (blank lines and #-comments ignored). The OTA
# install-systemd hook (apply_removals + _systemd_remover) disables+stops and
# removes each on deploy.
#
# Add an entry whenever you delete/rename a *.service that was previously
# shipped, so the removal propagates to already-provisioned stations.

# Renamed to ctt-board-detect.service (the tool now named for what it does:
# boot-time board detection + hardware identity).
ctt-station-id.service

# Removed: the V2 GPS-HAT kick. New boards have onboard GPS, so the HAT and its
# boot-time GPIO pulse are gone; this branch ships only on the new image.
ctt-gps-kick.service
